  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "paragraph_id": 1,
      "chunk_id": "SC_2024_ASHOK_KUMAR_SHARMA_VS_UNION_OF_INDIA_P001_C01",
      "text": "JUDGMENT\n1 The petition, invoking\nArticle 32\nof the Constitution, has been instituted by former civil",
      "paragraph_type": "unknown",
      "sections_cited": [
        "Constitution 32"
      ],
      "cited_cases": [],
      "chunk_number": 1
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": 2,
      "chunk_id": "SC_2024_ASHOK_KUMAR_SHARMA_VS_UNION_OF_INDIA_P002_C01",
      "text": "servants, scholars, activists and experts in fields such as International Relations,",
      "paragraph_type": "facts",
      "sections_cited": [],
      "cited_cases": [],
      "chunk_number": 1
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": 3,
      "chunk_id": "SC_2024_ASHOK_KUMAR_SHARMA_VS_UNION_OF_INDIA_P003_C01",
      "text": "Human Rights and Policy Analysis.\n2 The petition seeks directions to the Union Government to cancel existing",
      "paragraph_type": "facts",
      "sections_cited": [],
      "cited_cases": [],
      "chunk_number": 1
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": 4,
      "chunk_id": "SC_2024_ASHOK_KUMAR_SHARMA_VS_UNION_OF_INDIA_P004_C01",
      "text": "licences/permissions and to halt the grant of new licences to companies in India for",
      "paragraph_type": "facts",
      "sections_cited": [],
      "cited_cases": [],
      "chunk_number": 1
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": 5,
      "chunk_id": "SC_2024_ASHOK_KUMAR_SHARMA_VS_UNION_OF_INDIA_P005_C01",
      "text": "the export of arms and military equipment to Israel during the ongoing conflict in",
      "paragraph_type": "facts",
      "sections_cited": [],
      "cited_cases": [],
      "chunk_number": 1
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": 6,
      "chunk_id": "SC_2024_ASHOK_KUMAR_SHARMA_VS_UNION_OF_INDIA_P006_C01",
      "text": "Enterprise in the Ministry of Defence and private companies which have allegedly",
      "paragraph_type": "facts",
      "sections_cited": [],
      "cited_cases": [],
      "chunk_number": 1
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": 7,
      "chunk_id": "SC_2024_ASHOK_KUMAR_SHARMA_VS_UNION_OF_INDIA_P007_C01",
      "text": "in war crimes/genocide.\n4 In other words, the submission is that the continuation of the export licences would",
      "paragraph_type": "facts",
      "sections_cited": [],
      "cited_cases": [],
      "chunk_number": 1
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": 8,
      "chunk_id": "SC_2024_ASHOK_KUMAR_SHARMA_VS_UNION_OF_INDIA_P008_C01",
      "text": "international obligations which India has assumed.\n5 The fundamental objection to the maintainability of a petition of the nature that is",
      "paragraph_type": "facts",
      "sections_cited": [],
      "cited_cases": [],
      "chunk_number": 1
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": 9,
      "chunk_id": "SC_2024_ASHOK_KUMAR_SHARMA_VS_UNION_OF_INDIA_P009_C01",
      "text": "before the Court lies in the fact that the authority and jurisdiction in relation to the",
      "paragraph_type": "unknown",
      "sections_cited": [],
      "cited_cases": [],
      "chunk_number": 1
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": 10,
      "chunk_id": "SC_2024_ASHOK_KUMAR_SHARMA_VS_UNION_OF_INDIA_P010_C01",
      "text": "Constitution stipulate that Parliament has the power to make any law for the whole",
      "paragraph_type": "unknown",
      "sections_cited": [],
      "cited_cases": [],
      "chunk_number": 1
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": 11,
      "chunk_id": "SC_2024_ASHOK_KUMAR_SHARMA_VS_UNION_OF_INDIA_P011_C01",
      "text": "6 There is a presumption that international law is a part and parcel of the law of the",
      "paragraph_type": "unknown",
      "sections_cited": [],
      "cited_cases": [],
      "chunk_number": 1
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": 12,
      "chunk_id": "SC_2024_ASHOK_KUMAR_SHARMA_VS_UNION_OF_INDIA_P012_C01",
      "text": "nation unless the application of a principle of international law is excluded expressly",
      "paragraph_type": "unknown",
      "sections_cited": [],
      "cited_cases": [],
      "chunk_number": 1
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": 13,
      "chunk_id": "SC_2024_ASHOK_KUMAR_SHARMA_VS_UNION_OF_INDIA_P013_C01",
      "text": "or by necessary implication by the competent legislature. However, the basic issue",
      "paragraph_type": "unknown",
      "sections_cited": [],
      "cited_cases": [],
      "chunk_number": 1
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": 14,
      "chunk_id": "SC_2024_ASHOK_KUMAR_SHARMA_VS_UNION_OF_INDIA_P014_C01",
      "text": "which falls for consideration in the present proceedings is whether the Court under\nArticle 32\ncan issue a writ to the Union Government to cancel existing licences and",
      "paragraph_type": "unknown",
      "sections_cited": [],
      "cited_cases": [],
      "chunk_number": 1
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": 15,
      "chunk_id": "SC_2024_ASHOK_KUMAR_SHARMA_VS_UNION_OF_INDIA_P015_C01",
      "text": "halt the issuance of new licences for the export of arms and military equipments to",
      "paragraph_type": "unknown",
      "sections_cited": [],
      "cited_cases": [],
      "chunk_number": 1
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": 16,
      "chunk_id": "SC_2024_ASHOK_KUMAR_SHARMA_VS_UNION_OF_INDIA_P016_C01",
      "text": "Israel. We are affirmatively of the view that the answer to this question must be in",
      "paragraph_type": "unknown",
      "sections_cited": [],
      "cited_cases": [],
      "chunk_number": 1
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": 17,
      "chunk_id": "SC_2024_ASHOK_KUMAR_SHARMA_VS_UNION_OF_INDIA_P017_C01",
      "text": "the negative for more than one reason.\n7 First any grant of relief in the present proceedings is presaged on the submission of",
      "paragraph_type": "unknown",
      "sections_cited": [],
      "cited_cases": [],
      "chunk_number": 1
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": 18,
      "chunk_id": "SC_2024_ASHOK_KUMAR_SHARMA_VS_UNION_OF_INDIA_P018_C01",
      "text": "namely, Israel in the conduct of its operations in Gaza. The sovereign nation of Israel",
      "paragraph_type": "unknown",
      "sections_cited": [],
      "cited_cases": [],
      "chunk_number": 1
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": 19,
      "chunk_id": "SC_2024_ASHOK_KUMAR_SHARMA_VS_UNION_OF_INDIA_P019_C01",
      "text": "is not and cannot be made amenable to the jurisdiction of this Court. Hence, for",
      "paragraph_type": "unknown",
      "sections_cited": [],
      "cited_cases": [],
      "chunk_number": 1
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": 20,
      "chunk_id": "SC_2024_ASHOK_KUMAR_SHARMA_VS_UNION_OF_INDIA_P020_C01",
      "text": "this Court to consider the grant of the reliefs as sought, it would inevitably become",
      "paragraph_type": "unknown",
      "sections_cited": [],
      "cited_cases": [],
      "chunk_number": 1
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": 21,
      "chunk_id": "SC_2024_ASHOK_KUMAR_SHARMA_VS_UNION_OF_INDIA_P021_C01",
      "text": "necessary to enter a finding in regard to the allegations which have been leveled",
      "paragraph_type": "unknown",
      "sections_cited": [],
      "cited_cases": [],
      "chunk_number": 1
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": 22,
      "chunk_id": "SC_2024_ASHOK_KUMAR_SHARMA_VS_UNION_OF_INDIA_P022_C01",
      "text": "by the petitioners against the State of Israel. Absent jurisdiction over a sovereign",
      "paragraph_type": "unknown",
      "sections_cited": [],
      "cited_cases": [],
      "chunk_number": 1
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": 23,
      "chunk_id": "SC_2024_ASHOK_KUMAR_SHARMA_VS_UNION_OF_INDIA_P023_C01",
      "text": "State, It would be impermissible for this Court to entertain the grant of reliefs of this",
      "paragraph_type": "unknown",
      "sections_cited": [],
      "cited_cases": [],
      "chunk_number": 1
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": 24,
      "chunk_id": "SC_2024_ASHOK_KUMAR_SHARMA_VS_UNION_OF_INDIA_P024_C01",
      "text": "nature.\n8 The second aspect of the matter which requires to be noticed is that the petition",
      "paragraph_type": "unknown",
      "sections_cited": [],
      "cited_cases": [],
      "chunk_number": 1
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": 25,
      "chunk_id": "SC_2024_ASHOK_KUMAR_SHARMA_VS_UNION_OF_INDIA_P025_C01",
      "text": "seeks a cancellation of the existing licences and prohibition on the issuance of new",
      "paragraph_type": "unknown",
      "sections_cited": [],
      "cited_cases": [],
      "chunk_number": 1
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": 26,
      "chunk_id": "SC_2024_ASHOK_KUMAR_SHARMA_VS_UNION_OF_INDIA_P026_C01",
      "text": "licences for the export of arms and military equipments by Indian companies. Some",
      "paragraph_type": "unknown",
      "sections_cited": [],
      "cited_cases": [],
      "chunk_number": 1
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": 27,
      "chunk_id": "SC_2024_ASHOK_KUMAR_SHARMA_VS_UNION_OF_INDIA_P027_C01",
      "text": "of these licenses may be governed by contracts with international entities, including",
      "paragraph_type": "unknown",
      "sections_cited": [],
      "cited_cases": [],
      "chunk_number": 1
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": 28,
      "chunk_id": "SC_2024_ASHOK_KUMAR_SHARMA_VS_UNION_OF_INDIA_P028_C01",
      "text": "within the State of Israel. The grant of injunctive relief by this Court would necessarily",
      "paragraph_type": "unknown",
      "sections_cited": [],
      "cited_cases": [],
      "chunk_number": 1
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": 29,
      "chunk_id": "SC_2024_ASHOK_KUMAR_SHARMA_VS_UNION_OF_INDIA_P029_C01",
      "text": "implicate a judicial direction for breach of international contracts and agreements.",
      "paragraph_type": "unknown",
      "sections_cited": [],
      "cited_cases": [],
      "chunk_number": 1
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": 30,
      "chunk_id": "SC_2024_ASHOK_KUMAR_SHARMA_VS_UNION_OF_INDIA_P030_C01",
      "text": "The fall out of such breaches cannot be appropriately assessed by this Court and",
      "paragraph_type": "unknown",
      "sections_cited": [],
      "cited_cases": [],
      "chunk_number": 1
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": 31,
      "chunk_id": "SC_2024_ASHOK_KUMAR_SHARMA_VS_UNION_OF_INDIA_P031_C01",
      "text": "9 Third, the statutory provisions of our law confer sufficient power on the Union",
      "paragraph_type": "unknown",
      "sections_cited": [],
      "cited_cases": [],
      "chunk_number": 1
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": 32,
      "chunk_id": "SC_2024_ASHOK_KUMAR_SHARMA_VS_UNION_OF_INDIA_P032_C01",
      "text": "Government if it decides to act in such cases. For instance, prohibitions can be",
      "paragraph_type": "unknown",
      "sections_cited": [],
      "cited_cases": [],
      "chunk_number": 1
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": 33,
      "chunk_id": "SC_2024_ASHOK_KUMAR_SHARMA_VS_UNION_OF_INDIA_P033_C01",
      "text": "Whether in a given case, any such action is warranted is a matter which has to be",
      "paragraph_type": "unknown",
      "sections_cited": [],
      "cited_cases": [],
      "chunk_number": 1
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": 34,
      "chunk_id": "SC_2024_ASHOK_KUMAR_SHARMA_VS_UNION_OF_INDIA_P034_C01",
      "text": "other interests of the nation in the conduct of international relations. In taking an",
      "paragraph_type": "unknown",
      "sections_cited": [],
      "cited_cases": [],
      "chunk_number": 1
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": 35,
      "chunk_id": "SC_2024_ASHOK_KUMAR_SHARMA_VS_UNION_OF_INDIA_P035_C01",
      "text": "considerations including the commitments of the nation at the international level.",
      "paragraph_type": "unknown",
      "sections_cited": [],
      "cited_cases": [],
      "chunk_number": 1
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": 36,
      "chunk_id": "SC_2024_ASHOK_KUMAR_SHARMA_VS_UNION_OF_INDIA_P036_C01",
      "text": "10 The danger in the Court taking over this function is precisely that it would be led into",
      "paragraph_type": "unknown",
      "sections_cited": [],
      "cited_cases": [],
      "chunk_number": 1
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": 37,
      "chunk_id": "SC_2024_ASHOK_KUMAR_SHARMA_VS_UNION_OF_INDIA_P037_C01",
      "text": "issuing injunctive reliefs without a full and comprehensive analysis or backdrop of",
      "paragraph_type": "reasoning",
      "sections_cited": [],
      "cited_cases": [],
      "chunk_number": 1
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": 38,
      "chunk_id": "SC_2024_ASHOK_KUMAR_SHARMA_VS_UNION_OF_INDIA_P038_C01",
      "text": "the likely consequences of any such action. The self-imposed restraint on Courts",
      "paragraph_type": "reasoning",
      "sections_cited": [],
      "cited_cases": [],
      "chunk_number": 1
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": 39,
      "chunk_id": "SC_2024_ASHOK_KUMAR_SHARMA_VS_UNION_OF_INDIA_P039_C01",
      "text": "entering into areas of foreign policy is, thus, grounded in sound rationale which has",
      "paragraph_type": "reasoning",
      "sections_cited": [],
      "cited_cases": [],
      "chunk_number": 1
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": 40,
      "chunk_id": "SC_2024_ASHOK_KUMAR_SHARMA_VS_UNION_OF_INDIA_P040_C01",
      "text": "been applied across time.\n11 For the above reasons, we have come to the conclusion that the reliefs which have",
      "paragraph_type": "reasoning",
      "sections_cited": [],
      "cited_cases": [],
      "chunk_number": 1
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": 41,
      "chunk_id": "SC_2024_ASHOK_KUMAR_SHARMA_VS_UNION_OF_INDIA_P041_C01",
      "text": "remedies under\nArticle 32\nof the Constitution.\n12 We clarify that the observations which have been made in the earlier part of this",
      "paragraph_type": "reasoning",
      "sections_cited": [
        "Constitution 32"
      ],
      "cited_cases": [],
      "chunk_number": 1
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": 42,
      "chunk_id": "SC_2024_ASHOK_KUMAR_SHARMA_VS_UNION_OF_INDIA_P042_C01",
      "text": "judgment are not intended to reflect any opinion by this Court either in the conduct",
      "paragraph_type": "reasoning",
      "sections_cited": [],
      "cited_cases": [],
      "chunk_number": 1
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": 43,
      "chunk_id": "SC_2024_ASHOK_KUMAR_SHARMA_VS_UNION_OF_INDIA_P043_C01",
      "text": "of foreign policy by the Government of India, or for that matter, by any sovereign",
      "paragraph_type": "reasoning",
      "sections_cited": [],
      "cited_cases": [],
      "chunk_number": 1
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": 44,
      "chunk_id": "SC_2024_ASHOK_KUMAR_SHARMA_VS_UNION_OF_INDIA_P044_C01",
      "text": "impleadment stand disposed of.\n…...…...….......………………....…CJI.\n[Dr Dhananjaya Y Chandrachud]",
